<title>FINLAND: Finnish Feb jobless rate falls to 17.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Finnish Feb jobless rate falls to 17.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's jobless rate fell to 17.8 percent in February from 18.5 percent in January, the Labour Ministry said in its monthly employment survey on Monday.</p>
<p>			Feb 1997    Jan 1997	Feb 1996</p>
<p>    Unemployed     437,600     453,300	 462,000</p>
<p>    Jobless rate    17.8	  18.5	    19.0</p>
<p>The mean of four economists' forecasts for the February jobless rate measured by the labour ministry was 18.1 percent (range 18.0-18.2 pct). The ministry's data is not used in international comparisons. @</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
